# Segments to decide

{{ segments | tojson }}

# Delivery checks

1. Return exactly one decision per input segment, in input order. Never omit or duplicate an index,
   and never return an index outside the batch. The top-level output key is rewrites.
2. Core rewritten length must stay between
   {{ ((policy.min_length_ratio | default(0.5)) * 100) | round | int }}% and
   {{ ((policy.max_length_ratio | default(1.3)) * 100) | round | int }}% of the source.
3. Use an empty spoken_text when no change is warranted.
4. Each decision contains only segment_index, spoken_text, and a 0.0-1.0 semantic-equivalence confidence.
